  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>The best career options after 12th humanities are law, design, a BA (Hons), integrated
    management, teaching, the Army wing of NDA, psychology, media and hospitality.</strong>
    Your smartest first move is to check which doors close first and which ones need maths. A humanities
    stream does not cap your income. Choosing a path with no proof of skill behind it does.
