      <li>Career options after 12th humanities are wide, but the exam calendar decides which doors are still open. The CLAT registration window closes on 31 October 2026, and NID registration on 30 November 2026.</li>
      <li>Maths and age are the hidden gates: DU BA (Hons) Economics, the NDA written exam and IPMAT all need maths, and NDA, IPM and UCEED have age limits that a drop year can use up. Most other humanities BA routes have neither problem.</li>
